      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This could just be your own personal internet or PC not being capable enough to load his avatar. Since you are able to still talk to him and see everyone else, it may be a network issue. I would suggest you can your friend to a small world and have him load up into an VRchat avatar and see if that does the trick.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
