      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The bug is still a thing, and it's not just friends. It also tends to happen with the same people, but can happen to anyone, and they do not appear in social \"In Room\". Another way to fix it is to mute and unmute anyone else in the world. It seems like not many people know about this bug yet because no one really knows when they can't see a certain person.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
